  "description": "The data lifecycle after \"hot\" for the Goldpath enterprise asset: declarative retention per aggregate, archive runs that move whole GRAPHS into a tamper-evident same-database store (SHA-256 hash chain), row-retention purges for high-volume detail, legal hold, and erasure that composes with retention. Runs execute on Goldpath.Jobs - chunked, checkpointed, resumable, visible in the same console (archival RFC D1-D7).",
